# ============================================================
# 行尾统一规范 (2026-09-04, 文档归档战役)
# 存储层统一 LF; 工作区文本统一 CRLF (Windows 生态)
# ============================================================
* text=auto
*.md text eol=crlf
*.java text eol=crlf
*.py text eol=crlf
*.csv text eol=crlf
*.json text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.class binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.jfr binary
*.zip binary
*.replay binary
*.dat binary
